# Test Category Config Endpoints

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Get all categories to see current state
GET http://localhost:8000/api/categories
Accept: application/json

###

### Get specific category to see current config
GET http://localhost:8000/api/categories/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Test POST - Create config for category 1 (if it doesn't have one)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/categories/1/config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "config": {
    "theme": "blue",
    "enabled": true,
    "settings": {
      "auto_save": true,
      "notifications": false
    }
  }
}

###

### Test PATCH - Update config for category 1
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/categories/1/config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "config": {
    "theme": "green",
    "enabled": true,
    "settings": {
      "auto_save": false,
      "notifications": true,
      "advanced_mode": true
    }
  }
}

###

### Test POST on category that already has config (should return 400)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/categories/1/config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "config": {
    "theme": "red",
    "enabled": false
  }
}

###

### Test DELETE - Remove config from category 1
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/categories/1/config
Accept: application/json

###

### Test DELETE on category with no config (should return 404)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/categories/1/config
Accept: application/json

###

### Test operations on non-existent category (should return 404)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/categories/999
Accept: application/json

###

POST http://localhost:8000/api/categories/999/config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "config": {
    "theme": "purple",
    "enabled": true
  }
}

###

PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/categories/999/config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "config": {
    "theme": "orange",
    "enabled": false
  }
}

###

DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/categories/999/config
Accept: application/json

###

### Test with invalid JSON (should return 500)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/categories/1/config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "config": {
    "theme": "blue",
    "enabled": "invalid_boolean"
  }
}
